    "en": "PROPOSED, not built. Head 3D add-on for the tmj chapter: the skull bones and the muscles the bundled demo model lacks. It needs gui's yes first (AN-43). The file is named atlas-addon.proposed.json so that the build and CI do not treat it as an active add-on; after approval rename it to atlas-addon.json, run site/build/atlas/build-addon.py tmj and correct the source object names against the exporter's report.",
    "zh": "提议稿，尚未导出。头面部与颞下颌关节一章的 3D 附加模型：自带演示模型里没有的颅骨和肌肉。要先经 gui 同意（AN-43）。文件名用 atlas-addon.proposed.json，构建和 CI 不会把它当成已启用的附加模型；同意后改名为 atlas-addon.json，运行 site/build/atlas/build-addon.py tmj，并按导出报告核对源网格名。"
